  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 1: SWE-Router overview diagram. The left panel shows Conventional LLM Routing, where task prompt q is classified by router r_hat(q) to weak m1 or strong m2, facing high Bayes error due to lack of trajectory context. The right panel shows SWE-Router: weak model m1 executes K exploration steps; value head r_hat(T_<=K) evaluates partial trajectory to predict m1 success, continuing with m1 if high or escalating to strong m2 restarted from q if low.",
